#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:2
msgid "Two-Node Clusters with a Witness"
msgstr "Clusters de Dois Nós com Witness"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:6
msgid ""
"A two-node HVM cluster can use an HPE Shared File System (GFS2) datastore"
" when a Distributed Worker provides an independent quorum vote. This "
"topology is available for HVM layout 1.3 or later and applies wherever "
"HVM is included, including HPE VM Essentials, HPE Morpheus Enterprise "
"Software, and HPE Morpheus Advanced Software."
msgstr "Um cluster HVM de dois nós pode usar um datastore HPE Shared File System (GFS2) quando um Distributed Worker fornece um voto de quorum independente. Esta topologia está disponível para o layout HVM 1.3 ou posterior e se aplica onde quer que o HVM esteja incluído, incluindo HPE VM Essentials, HPE Morpheus Enterprise Software e HPE Morpheus Advanced Software."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:8
msgid ""
"The witness is a quorum-only member. It does not run VMs, mount the GFS2 "
"datastore, or become an HVM compute Host. Deploy it outside the failure "
"domain shared by the two HVM Hosts."
msgstr "O witness é um membro apenas de quorum. Ele não executa VMs, não monta o datastore GFS2 nem se torna um Host de computação HVM. Implante-o fora do domínio de falha compartilhado pelos dois Hosts HVM."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:11
msgid "Topology"
msgstr "Topologia"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:13
msgid "The logical quorum has three members:"
msgstr "O quorum lógico tem três membros:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:15
msgid "HVM Host 1"
msgstr "HVM Host 1"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:16
msgid "HVM Host 2"
msgstr "HVM Host 2"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:17
msgid "One Distributed Worker witness"
msgstr "Um witness Distributed Worker"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:19
msgid ""
"The two Hosts communicate with each other on the Agent quorum network. "
"Each Host must also resolve, reach, and trust the HTTPS Worker URL. "
"|morpheus| derives the witness endpoint as ``<Worker "
"URL>/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum``."
msgstr "Os dois Hosts se comunicam entre si na rede de quorum do Agente. Cada Host também deve resolver, alcançar e confiar na Worker URL HTTPS. O |morpheus| deriva o endpoint do witness como ``<Worker URL>/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:21
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:21
msgid ""
"The Worker's outbound connection to the |morpheus| appliance does not "
"prove that the HVM Hosts can reach the witness. Validate the Host-to-"
"Worker path independently."
msgstr "A conexão de saída do Worker para o appliance |morpheus| não prova que os Hosts HVM conseguem alcançar o witness. Valide o caminho Host-to-Worker de forma independente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:24
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Pré-requisitos"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:26
msgid "|morpheus| Manager 9.0 or later"
msgstr "Manager |morpheus| 9.0 ou posterior"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:27
msgid "An HVM layout 1.3 or later cluster with exactly two compatible Hosts"
msgstr "Um cluster de layout HVM 1.3 ou posterior com exatamente dois Hosts compatíveis"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:28
msgid "Static management addresses and Host-to-Host connectivity on TCP 7443"
msgstr "Endereços de gerenciamento estáticos e conectividade Host-to-Host em TCP 7443"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:29
msgid ""
"Shared block storage, such as iSCSI or Fibre Channel, visible to both "
"Hosts"
msgstr "Armazenamento em bloco compartilhado, como iSCSI ou Fibre Channel, visível para ambos os Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:30
msgid "One Distributed Worker outside the two-Host failure domain"
msgstr "Um Distributed Worker fora do domínio de falha dos dois Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:31
msgid ""
"A stable Worker URL whose DNS name, route, firewall port, and certificate"
" chain are valid from both Hosts"
msgstr "Uma Worker URL estável cujo nome DNS, rota, porta de firewall e cadeia de certificados sejam válidos a partir de ambos os Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:32
msgid ""
"Enough capacity on either Host to run the workloads that must remain "
"available while the other Host is offline"
msgstr "Capacidade suficiente em qualquer Host para executar as cargas que devem permanecer disponíveis enquanto o outro Host estiver offline"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:34
msgid ""
"The Worker URL can terminate TLS directly on the Worker or through a "
"supported reverse proxy or load balancer. Preserve the "
"``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` path when a proxy is used. The "
"external HTTPS port is the port in the configured Worker URL; do not "
"assume the Worker's internal application port is exposed directly."
msgstr "A Worker URL pode encerrar TLS diretamente no Worker ou por meio de um reverse proxy ou load balancer suportado. Preserve o caminho ``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` quando um proxy for usado. A porta HTTPS externa é a porta na Worker URL configurada; não assuma que a porta interna da aplicação do Worker está exposta diretamente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:37
msgid "Deployment"
msgstr "Implantação"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:39
msgid ""
"Create the two-Host HVM cluster using :doc:`building_clusters`. Do not "
"add the GFS2 datastore yet."
msgstr "Crie o cluster HVM de dois Hosts usando :doc:`building_clusters`. Ainda não adicione o datastore GFS2."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:40
msgid ""
"Deploy and register a Distributed Worker using :ref:`hvm-witness-"
"deployment`."
msgstr "Implante e registre um Distributed Worker usando :ref:`hvm-witness-deployment`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:41
msgid ""
"From both HVM Hosts, verify DNS resolution and TLS connectivity to the "
"Worker URL."
msgstr "A partir de ambos os Hosts HVM, verifique a resolução DNS e a conectividade TLS com a Worker URL."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:42
msgid ""
"Edit the HVM cluster, select the Distributed Worker in the **Witness** "
"field, and save the cluster."
msgstr "Edite o cluster HVM, selecione o Distributed Worker no campo **Witness** e salve o cluster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:43
msgid ""
"Add the shared block-storage target to both Hosts and confirm both Hosts "
"resolve the same stable multipath device. See :doc:`storage_operations`."
msgstr "Adicione o destino de armazenamento em bloco compartilhado a ambos os Hosts e confirme que ambos resolvem o mesmo dispositivo multipath estável. Consulte :doc:`storage_operations`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:44
msgid ""
"Create the HPE Shared File System (GFS2) datastore and select one "
"reliable datastore as the **Heartbeat Target**."
msgstr "Crie o datastore HPE Shared File System (GFS2) e selecione um datastore confiável como **Heartbeat Target**."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:45
msgid "Open the cluster **Summary** tab and verify the Quorum panel."
msgstr "Abra a aba **Summary** do cluster e verifique o painel Quorum."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:47
msgid ""
"The Manager sends Agent quorum information only after a GFS2 datastore "
"exists. The selected Worker may therefore appear active as a Distributed "
"Worker before it appears as an HVM quorum member. Adding the GFS2 "
"datastore activates the three-member Agent quorum workflow."
msgstr "O Manager envia informações de quorum do Agente somente após existir um datastore GFS2. O Worker selecionado pode, portanto, aparecer ativo como Distributed Worker antes de aparecer como membro de quorum HVM. Adicionar o datastore GFS2 ativa o fluxo de quorum do Agente com três membros."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:49
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Alerta"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:49
msgid ""
"Do not place production workloads on a new GFS2 datastore until all three"
" quorum members are reachable and the Quorum panel reports a healthy "
"state."
msgstr "Não posicione cargas de produção em um novo datastore GFS2 até que todos os três membros de quorum estejam reachable e o painel Quorum reporte um estado saudável."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:54
msgid "Witness Deployment"
msgstr "Implantação do Witness"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:56
msgid "Navigate to |AdmIntDis| and create a Distributed Worker configuration."
msgstr "Navegue até |AdmIntDis| e crie uma configuração de Distributed Worker."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:57
msgid "Set **Worker URL** to the stable client-facing HTTPS URL for the Worker."
msgstr "Defina **Worker URL** como a URL HTTPS estável voltada ao cliente para o Worker."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:58
msgid "Save the API key."
msgstr "Salve a chave de API."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:59
msgid ""
"Install and configure the Worker using the package or container procedure"
" in :doc:`/administration/integrations/workers`."
msgstr "Instale e configure o Worker usando o procedimento de pacote ou container em :doc:`/administration/integrations/workers`."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:60
msgid "Confirm the Worker is active in |AdmIntDis|."
msgstr "Confirme que o Worker está ativo em |AdmIntDis|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:61
msgid ""
"From each HVM Host, verify the configured DNS name and TLS path. For "
"example:"
msgstr "A partir de cada Host HVM, verifique o nome DNS configurado e o caminho TLS. Por exemplo:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:63
msgid ""
"getent hosts witness.example.com\n"
"curl --head https://witness.example.com"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:68
msgid ""
"Do not use ``--insecure`` for production validation. If a reverse proxy "
"or load balancer fronts the Worker, also confirm it preserves the witness"
" path and does not require interactive authentication."
msgstr "Não use ``--insecure`` para validação de produção. Se um reverse proxy ou load balancer estiver na frente do Worker, confirme também que ele preserva o caminho do witness e não exige autenticação interativa."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:71
msgid "Quorum Validation"
msgstr "Validação de Quorum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:73
msgid ""
"After adding the GFS2 datastore, open the cluster Quorum panel and "
"confirm:"
msgstr "Após adicionar o datastore GFS2, abra o painel Quorum do cluster e confirme:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:75
msgid "Quorum status is **ACHIEVED**"
msgstr "O status do quorum é **ACHIEVED**"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:76
msgid "Two compute Hosts and one witness are configured"
msgstr "Dois Hosts de computação e um witness estão configurados"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:77
msgid "Both Hosts are online and reachable"
msgstr "Ambos os Hosts estão online e reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:78
msgid "The witness is reachable"
msgstr "O witness está reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:79
msgid "A Designated Coordinator is assigned"
msgstr "Um Designated Coordinator está atribuído"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:80
msgid "GFS2 lockspaces are healthy and not waiting for fencing"
msgstr "Os lockspaces GFS2 estão saudáveis e não aguardam fencing"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:81
msgid "The selected heartbeat datastore is healthy on both Hosts"
msgstr "O datastore de heartbeat selecionado está saudável em ambos os Hosts"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:83
msgid ""
"Corosync supplies membership information to DLM but does not decide Agent"
" quorum for layout 1.3 or later. A two-node cluster can show ``Quorate: "
"No`` in ``corosync-quorumtool`` while the Agent Quorum panel correctly "
"reports **ACHIEVED**. Use the Agent quorum state as the operational "
"authority."
msgstr "O Corosync fornece informações de associação ao DLM, mas não decide o quorum do Agente no layout 1.3 ou posterior. Um cluster de dois nós pode mostrar ``Quorate: No`` em ``corosync-quorumtool`` enquanto o painel Quorum do Agente reporta corretamente **ACHIEVED**. Use o estado de quorum do Agente como autoridade operacional."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:86
msgid "Failure and Maintenance Behavior"
msgstr "Comportamento de Falha e Manutenção"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:92
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Condição"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:93
msgid "Available votes"
msgstr "Votos disponíveis"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:94
msgid "Expected behavior"
msgstr "Comportamento esperado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:95
msgid "Both Hosts and witness reachable"
msgstr "Ambos os Hosts e o witness reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:96
msgid "3 of 3"
msgstr "3 de 3"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:97
msgid "Normal operation"
msgstr "Operação normal"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:98
msgid "One Host unavailable; witness reachable"
msgstr "Um Host indisponível; witness reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:99
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:102
msgid "2 of 3"
msgstr "2 de 3"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:100
msgid ""
"The surviving Host retains quorum; eligible VMs can recover after the "
"heartbeat failure threshold"
msgstr "O Host sobrevivente mantém o quorum; VMs elegíveis podem se recuperar após o limiar de falha de heartbeat"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:101
msgid "Witness unavailable; both Hosts reachable"
msgstr "Witness indisponível; ambos os Hosts reachable"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:103
msgid ""
"The cluster retains quorum, but no Host may be taken offline until "
"witness service is restored"
msgstr "O cluster mantém o quorum, mas nenhum Host pode ser colocado offline até que o serviço do witness seja restaurado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:104
msgid "One Host and the witness unavailable"
msgstr "Um Host e o witness indisponíveis"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:105
msgid "1 of 3"
msgstr "1 de 3"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:106
msgid ""
"The remaining Host cannot retain quorum and protects shared storage by "
"fencing"
msgstr "O Host restante não pode manter o quorum e protege o armazenamento compartilhado por fencing"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:107
msgid "Host-to-Host partition"
msgstr "Partição Host-to-Host"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:108
msgid "Depends on witness reachability"
msgstr "Depende da acessibilidade do witness"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:109
msgid ""
"The Host that can reach the witness can form 2 of 3 votes; the other Host"
" cannot retain quorum"
msgstr "O Host que consegue alcançar o witness pode formar 2 de 3 votos; o outro Host não pode manter o quorum"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:110
msgid "|morpheus| Manager unavailable"
msgstr "Manager |morpheus| indisponível"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:111
msgid "Unchanged"
msgstr "Inalterado"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:112
msgid ""
"Agent and witness quorum continue independently; UI management is "
"unavailable until the Manager returns"
msgstr "O quorum do Agente e do witness continua de forma independente; o gerenciamento pela UI fica indisponível até o Manager retornar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:114
msgid ""
"For planned Host maintenance, confirm the witness and the other Host are "
"healthy before entering maintenance mode. Do not maintain a Host and the "
"witness at the same time. Restore all three members before beginning "
"maintenance on the second Host."
msgstr "Para manutenção planejada de Host, confirme que o witness e o outro Host estão saudáveis antes de entrar no modo de manutenção. Não mantenha um Host e o witness ao mesmo tempo. Restaure todos os três membros antes de iniciar a manutenção no segundo Host."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:117
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Solução de Problemas"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:119
msgid ""
"**Worker active but witness unreachable:** The Worker can reach the "
"Manager, but one or both Hosts cannot reach the Worker URL. Correct DNS, "
"routing, firewall, proxy, or certificate trust."
msgstr "**Worker ativo, mas witness unreachable:** O Worker consegue alcançar o Manager, mas um ou ambos os Hosts não conseguem alcançar a Worker URL. Corrija DNS, roteamento, firewall, proxy ou confiança no certificado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Witness absent from the Quorum panel:** Confirm the Worker is selected "
"on the cluster and a GFS2 datastore exists. Allow the cluster refresh to "
"propagate updated quorum information."
msgstr "**Witness ausente do painel Quorum:** Confirme que o Worker está selecionado no cluster e que existe um datastore GFS2. Permita que o refresh do cluster propague as informações atualizadas de quorum."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Wrong witness URL:** Set **Worker URL** to the client-facing Worker "
"endpoint, not the |morpheus| appliance URL. Verify the generated "
"``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` route through any proxy."
msgstr "**URL de witness incorreta:** Defina **Worker URL** como o endpoint do Worker voltado ao cliente, não a URL do appliance |morpheus|. Verifique a rota gerada ``/witness/<cluster UUID>/quorum`` por meio de qualquer proxy."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:122
msgid ""
"**Certificate error:** Serve a complete certificate chain trusted by both"
" HVM Hosts. Do not bypass certificate validation."
msgstr "**Erro de certificado:** Sirva uma cadeia de certificados completa confiada por ambos os Hosts HVM. Não ignore a validação de certificado."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:123
msgid ""
"**GFS2 lockspace waiting for fencing:** Do not issue manual fence "
"acknowledgements until the unreachable Host is physically isolated from "
"shared storage. Follow :doc:`troubleshooting` or contact HPE Support."
msgstr "**Lockspace GFS2 aguardando fencing:** Não emita reconhecimentos manuais de fence até que o Host unreachable esteja fisicamente isolado do armazenamento compartilhado. Siga :doc:`troubleshooting` ou contate o HPE Support."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:124
msgid ""
"**Witness lost during Host maintenance:** Stop the maintenance operation "
"if possible and restore either the witness or the Host before making "
"another member unavailable."
msgstr "**Witness perdido durante a manutenção do Host:** Interrompa a operação de manutenção se possível e restaure o witness ou o Host antes de tornar outro membro indisponível."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:127
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Limitações"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:129
msgid ""
"A two-node cluster has less compute and maintenance capacity than a "
"three-node cluster."
msgstr "Um cluster de dois nós tem menos capacidade de computação e manutenção do que um cluster de três nós."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:130
msgid ""
"The witness is required for Host-failure tolerance; two Hosts without the"
" witness cannot tolerate either Host becoming unavailable."
msgstr "O witness é necessário para tolerância a falha de Host; dois Hosts sem o witness não podem tolerar que qualquer Host fique indisponível."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:131
msgid ""
"This topology is not a stretch cluster. It does not use site groups or "
"the ``siteWitness`` designation."
msgstr "Esta topologia não é um stretch cluster. Ela não usa site groups nem a designação ``siteWitness``."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:132
msgid ""
"The witness does not replace shared-storage redundancy, multipathing, "
"backups, or sufficient capacity on the surviving Host."
msgstr "O witness não substitui a redundância de armazenamento compartilhado, multipathing, backups ou capacidade suficiente no Host sobrevivente."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:133
msgid ""
"Configure one heartbeat target. If it becomes unhealthy, restore it or "
"select another healthy GFS2 datastore before relying on automatic VM "
"recovery."
msgstr "Configure um destino de heartbeat. Se ele ficar com status ruim, restaure-o ou selecione outro datastore GFS2 saudável antes de confiar na recuperação automática de VMs."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/two_node_clusters.rst:135
msgid "For multi-site HVM clusters with site groups, see :doc:`stretch_clusters`."
msgstr "Para clusters HVM multi-site com site groups, consulte :doc:`stretch_clusters`."

